  <ul>
   <li>Access control analysis=20
    <ul>
     <li><u>Current</u>: APIs look at <span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">scopes=
 but not resource assignments</span></li>
    </ul></li>
   <li>System-to-firm report workflow analysis</li>
   <li>Report retrieval connector analysis</li>
   <li>Data system analysis (i.e. mapping rules)</li>
  </ul>
 </div>
