   <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"Functional Requirements" da=
ta-hash=3D"tab-Functional+Requirements">
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 52.7303%;letter-spacing: 0.0px;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 15.8216%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 21.4457%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 62.7327%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Req. No.</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.001</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>List system reports</p>
         <p>Report Retrieval API (<a href=3D"#FirmAttestation-reportretriev=
al">see ref.</a>)</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <pre>POST /reports</pre>
          <p><strong>Request Body</strong></p>
          <pre>  {<br>    "function": "",
    "object": "",
    //additional criteria, contextual to the function &amp; object
  }</pre>
          <pre><br></pre>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.002</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Download system reports</p>
         <p>Report Retrieval API (<a href=3D"#FirmAttestation-reportretriev=
al">see ref.</a>)</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <pre class=3D"content-wrapper">GET /reports/{reportId}?function=3D=
{function}&amp;object=3D{object}</pre></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.003</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Attestation report store</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Object naming convention:</p>
         <pre>/attestation/{firm id}/{label}/main_{createdDate}.csv</pre>
         <p>Tags:</p>
         <pre>version: [&lt;empty&gt;, "current"]</pre></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.004</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Attestation report download naming conve=
ntion</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Upon download, the report file must be named as such:</p>
         <pre>{firmId}_{label}-compass_user_access.csv</pre></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.005</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Report store versioning</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Versioning must be enabled so that we can retrieve older versio=
ns of overwritten files for audit purposes.</p>
         <p>p.s. For the moment, no other functionality (frontend/backend) =
will be made available to retrieve older versions.</p></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
   </div>
